,[308,790,47],{"href":791},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Fmessages#overridable-items",". The search matches the ",[299,794,763],{}," field and is not affected by the display format. With only a few items, pass ",[299,797,798],{},":search-input=\"false\""," to hide the search input.",[347,801],{"name":802},"select-menu-search",[321,804,806],{"id":805},"variants","Variants",[296,808,809,810,813,814,366,817,820,821,345],{},"Uses the ",[299,811,812],{},"variant",", ",[299,815,816],{},"color",[299,818,819],{},"highlight"," of ",[299,822,770],{},[347,824],{"name":825},"select-menu-variant",[321,827,829],{"id":828},"icon","Icon",[296,831,809,832,366,834,820,837,839,840,842,843,845],{},[299,833,828],{},[299,835,836],{},"trailing-icon",[299,838,770],{},"; ",[299,841,828],{}," shows on the left, and ",[299,844,836],{}," replaces the arrow on the right.",[347,847],{"name":848},"select-menu-icon",[321,850,852],{"id":851},"size-and-states","Size and states",[296,854,855,856,859],{},"While loading, a spinner replaces the arrow on the right and the menu is disabled. Switching to skeleton, disabled or loading closes an open menu, and it does not reopen afterwards. See ",[308,857,102],{"href":858},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon"," for the behavior shared by all states.",[347,861],{"name":862},"select-menu-states",[316,864,866],{"id":865},"examples","Examples",[321,868,870],{"id":869},"with-form-validation","With form validation",[296,872,873,874,876,877,880,881,876,883,345],{},"An empty single selection is ",[299,875,336],{},", so use ",[299,878,879],{},"requiredText","; an empty multiple selection is ",[299,882,344],{},[299,884,885],{},"requiredArray",[347,887],{"name":888},"select-menu-validation",[321,890,892],{"id":891},"truncated-text-tooltip","Truncated text tooltip",[296,894,895,896,899,900,306,903,907],{},"When the selected text is wider than the field, it is truncated with an ellipsis, and a tooltip shows the full text on hover or focus, or on long press on touch devices (see ",[308,897,217],{"href":898},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fhelper\u002Ftooltip#touch-long-press","); a long press does not open the menu. The tooltip is not shown while the menu is open. Set the width on ",[299,901,902],{},"ui.wrapper",[308,904,906],{"href":905},"#styling","Styling"," below.",[347,909],{"name":910},"select-menu-truncate",[321,912,914],{"id":913},"loading-items-asynchronously","Loading items asynchronously",[296,916,917,918,921,922,924,925,928],{},"While fetching items from the back end, use ",[299,919,920],{},"loading"," to show a spinner and disable the menu, then fill in ",[299,923,431],{}," when the request completes. When the bound value has no matching item, ",[299,926,927],{},"placeholder"," is shown, and the label appears automatically once the items arrive.",[347,930],{"name":931},"select-menu-async",[321,933,935],{"id":934},"dependent-menus","Dependent menus",[296,937,938,939,941],{},"When the city changes, the district is cleared, and the district ",[299,940,431],{}," are computed from the city.",[347,943],{"name":944},"select-menu-cascade",[321,946,948],{"id":947},"opening-the-menu","Opening the menu",[296,950,951,952,955,956,959],{},"Get the trigger button through ",[299,953,954],{},"triggerRef"," on the template ref and call ",[299,957,958],{},"click()"," to open the menu.",[347,961],{"name":962},"select-menu-expose",[316,964,966],{"id":965},"props","Props",[968,969],"component-props",{"name":404},[296,971,972,973,976,977,813,980,813,983,813,985,813,988,366,991,345],{},"See ",[308,974,102],{"href":975},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon#shared-props"," for the behavior of ",[299,978,979],{},"size",[299,981,982],{},"disabled",[299,984,920],{},[299,986,987],{},"skeleton",[299,989,990],{},"id",[299,992,993],{},"name",[296,995,996,997,1000,1001,366,1003,1006],{},"When ",[299,998,999],{},"open"," is not set, the user opens and closes the menu; there is no v-model for it. The types of ",[299,1002,570],{},[299,1004,10